abstract: >-
  SampoNLP is a high-performance library for unsupervised morpheme discovery
  from raw text corpora, implementing the Iterative Morpheme Decomposition 
  with Positional Priors (IMDP) algorithm.
keywords:
  - morphology
  - NLP
  - Uralic languages
  - unsupervised learning
  - morpheme segmentation
